# Proposals

`PROP-NNNNNN` docs — reviewable, agent-mediated write requests created
by `catalyst-ui`'s "propose fix" (health board) and "compose proposal"
(authoring) affordances (`RM-000004`/`RM-000005`). Deployment-local
artifact type, not a catalyst framework-wide concept — `packages/
catalyst-core` (in the `catalyst-ui` product) is what knows how to parse
this directory, the same way a deployment can define a new rule domain
on its own. None yet; `proposals.md` is the index and `templates/
TEMPLATE-PROPOSAL-v1.md` the template. See `rules/catalyst-core-rules.md`
(`core-CONTRACT-002`) and `rules/catalyst-host-vscode-rules.md`
(`PROPOSAL` domain).
